      "message": "Please follow the guidelines at:\n\nhttps://android.googlesource.com/kernel/common/+/refs/heads/android-mainline/README.md\n\nSpecifically, a `BACKPORT:` tag needs you to:\n\n\"add comments about the changes under the (cherry picked from commit ...) line\"\n\nSo you might have something like:\n\n(Cherry picked from commit 0db211ec0f1d32b93486e8f6565249ad4d1bece5 stable/linux.git linux-6.1.y)\n[Qi Feng: Cherry-picked from -stable backport]\n\nFollowed by your Signed-off-by line.\n\nThere are examples of this in the README that I have linked to twice in this comment thread. Please have a look at them.",
